			"notes": "## Item Peek 1.2.0\n\n- Added server-side item spam protection:\n  - cooldown;\n  - shared rate limiting;\n  - duplicate message protection;\n  - operator bypass.\n- Added runtime server configuration.\n- Added `/itempeek` administrative commands.\n- Added private-message alias management.\n- Improved support for `/msg`, `/tell`, `/w`, and namespaced commands.\n- Added TTL and one-time use protection for prepared items.\n- Improved payload validation and server-side checks.\n- Moved Beautified Chat Server support into an optional compatibility layer with fallback behavior.\n- Added optional Catalogue branding metadata.\n- Added English and Russian localization for new messages.\n- Updated the README with configuration and command documentation."
		},
